  "abstract": "This submission continues the ablation study on the `embedding_dim` hyperparameter. It evaluates an `embedding_dim` of 16, a larger size than previously tested (4 and 8), to explore the impact of increased embedding dimensionality on forecasting accuracy for the ZAPBench dataset.",
